WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:12.510 --> 00:00:17.310
House of the Dragon is a Game of Thrones prequel
show that is confirmed by HBO’s president

00:00:17.310 --> 00:00:20.830
to air in 2022.
It is based on George RR Martin’s book Fire

00:00:20.830 --> 00:00:25.700
And Blood volume 1 and on Martin’s yet unfinished
Fire And Blood volume 2 book.

00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:30.160
“Fire &amp; Blood begins their tale with the
legendary Aegon the Conqueror, creator of

00:00:30.160 --> 00:00:34.760
the Iron Throne, and goes on to recount the
generations of Targaryens who fought to hold

00:00:34.760 --> 00:00:40.050
that iconic seat, all the way up to the civil
war that nearly tore their dynasty apart.”

00:00:40.050 --> 00:00:45.220
That's Fire And Blood volume 1. The yet unreleased
Fire And Blood volume 2 will continue from

00:00:45.220 --> 00:00:51.110
where part 1 ended, with Rhaenyra Targaryen's
son Aegon lll's reign and will cover Blackyre

00:00:51.110 --> 00:00:56.230
rebellions, war with Dorne and go all the
way to the Mad King and Robert's Rebellion

00:00:56.230 --> 00:01:00.350
that ended Targaryen dynasty.
The key event of the prequel will be the Dance

00:01:00.350 --> 00:01:05.300
of the Dragon, a Targaryen civil war.
It's been confirmed that English actor Paddy

00:01:05.300 --> 00:01:11.049
Considine will star in the prequel as King
Viserys I Targaryen, a key figure from prelude

00:01:11.049 --> 00:01:14.390
to the Dance of the Dragons.
The official description of the character

00:01:14.390 --> 00:01:18.470
released by HBO describes him:
“King Viserys Targaryen is chosen by the

00:01:18.470 --> 00:01:23.370
lords of Westeros to succeed the Old King,
Jaehaerys Targaryen, at the Great Council

00:01:23.370 --> 00:01:29.580
at Harrenhal. A warm, kind, and decent man,
Viserys only wishes to carry forward his grandfather’s

00:01:29.580 --> 00:01:33.120
legacy.
But good men do not necessarily make for great

00:01:33.120 --> 00:01:36.130
kings.”
Miguel Sapochnik and Ryan Condal will serve

00:01:36.130 --> 00:01:41.350
as showrunners and executive producers. George
R. R. Martin will also serve as executive

00:01:41.350 --> 00:01:44.310
producer.
The Dance of the Dragons was the most devastating

00:01:44.310 --> 00:01:49.060
war in the history of the Seven Kingdoms.
A war of succession between Aegon II and his

00:01:49.060 --> 00:01:53.210
half-sister Rhaenyra over their father Viserys
I's throne.

00:01:53.210 --> 00:01:57.140
Both of them thought they belonged on the
Iron Throne. When people started declaring

00:01:57.140 --> 00:02:02.530
for one of them or the other, their fight
divided the kingdoms in two. Targaryens fought

00:02:02.530 --> 00:02:07.920
Targaryens, bothers fought brothers, dragons
fought dragons. By the time it was over, thousands

00:02:07.920 --> 00:02:12.230
were dead. The conflict would prove to be
incredibly destructive for not only House

00:02:12.230 --> 00:02:17.550
Targaryen, but large parts of Westeros as
well. In addition, it devastated the Targaryen's

00:02:17.550 --> 00:02:21.950
dragon population, ultimately leading to their
extinction within a few decades.

00:02:21.950 --> 00:02:25.939
They never truly recovered.
By the end of the reign of King Viserys I

00:02:25.939 --> 00:02:30.230
Targaryen, twenty dragons were alive. The
majority of these died during the civil war

00:02:30.230 --> 00:02:38.200
called the Dance of the Dragons, which began
in 129 AC and lasted until mid 131 AC.

00:02:38.200 --> 00:02:43.040
One of the main characters in this series
is going to be King Viserys I Targaryen

00:02:43.040 --> 00:02:48.279
or at least in season 1 until he dies and
his death starts the Targaryen civil war.

00:02:48.279 --> 00:02:51.310
House of the Dragon will not jump straight
into the fighting,

00:02:51.310 --> 00:02:55.349
but will rather start with a build-up towards
it, towards the Dance of the Dragons.

00:02:55.349 --> 00:03:00.219
It will start with King Viserys l and his
reign. He will live long enough for the series

00:03:00.219 --> 00:03:04.340
to introduce us to all the main characters
that are going to be important in the Targaryen

00:03:04.340 --> 00:03:09.220
civil war and which side they support as the
future heir, as well as to set up all the

00:03:09.220 --> 00:03:13.669
animosity at the court.
Viserys I Targaryen was the fifth Targaryen

00:03:13.669 --> 00:03:19.629
King to sit the Iron Throne, ruling from 103
AC to 129 AC.

00:03:19.629 --> 00:03:23.420
He succeeded his grandfather, the Old King
Jaehaerys I.

00:03:23.420 --> 00:03:27.670
Viserys continued the prosperous peace and
legacy of his grandsire,

00:03:27.670 --> 00:03:30.400
but the seeds for the civil war known as the
Dance of the Dragon

00:03:30.400 --> 00:03:35.300
that would much later engulf the realm were
inadvertently sown in his reign.

00:03:35.300 --> 00:03:40.409
Viserys was a dragon rider who rode Balerion
until the dragon died of old age during the

00:03:40.409 --> 00:03:46.549
reign of Jaehaerys I. Viserys never bonded
with another dragon after Balerion's death.

00:03:46.549 --> 00:03:49.819
Let's get a bit back to explain how Viserys,
who was not a son of a King

00:03:49.819 --> 00:03:55.829
nor a son of King's eldest son, became a King.
When King Jaehaerys I Targaryen's son and

00:03:55.829 --> 00:04:00.680
heir, Prince Aemon, died in 92 AC,
Jaehaerys chose Aemon's younger brother, Prince

00:04:00.680 --> 00:04:04.930
Baelon, as his heir, passing over Aemon's
daughter, Princess Rhaenys.

00:04:04.930 --> 00:04:10.389
However, Prince Baelon died as well in 101
AC while serving as Hand of the King,

00:04:10.389 --> 00:04:16.449
leaving behind him two sons, Viserys and Daemon.
The Old King once again needed an heir.

00:04:16.449 --> 00:04:21.560
With Jaehaerys I in decline and unable to
choose his new heir after Baelon's death,

00:04:21.560 --> 00:04:26.669
a Great Council was held in 101 AC at Harrenhal
to determine who would succeed him.

00:04:26.669 --> 00:04:31.710
Aemon's daughter Rhaenys was a candidate,
as were her children Laenor and Laena Velaryon.

00:04:31.710 --> 00:04:37.080
But the council ruled in favor of Viserys
I, given that he was Baelon's heir,

00:04:37.080 --> 00:04:40.800
and Jaehaerys had favored Baelon over his
granddaughter Rhaenys.

00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:45.140
And so the Old King named Viserys his heir,
the new Prince of Dragonstone

00:04:45.140 --> 00:04:48.660
and upon the Old Kings death, Viserys became
a new King.

00:04:48.660 --> 00:04:52.750
House Targaryen was at its most powerful during
Viserys's time,

00:04:52.750 --> 00:04:55.870
having the most members and dragons since
the Doom of Valyria.

00:04:55.870 --> 00:05:00.250
Viserys was known as the Young King when he
ascended the Throne.

00:05:00.250 --> 00:05:04.320
Holding a court with Queen Aemma Arryn, the
Young King was determined to maintain the

00:05:04.320 --> 00:05:07.440
peace and goodwill of his grandfather Jaehaerys
the Wise.

00:05:07.440 --> 00:05:12.730
They had a son who died in infancy and a daughter,
Princess Rhaenyra who was six when her father

00:05:12.730 --> 00:05:17.460
became a king. The princess became his royal
cupbearer at the age of eight

00:05:17.460 --> 00:05:21.770
and was always by her father's side at feasts,
balls, and tourneys.

00:05:21.770 --> 00:05:27.470
Rhaenyra was dubbed "the realm's delight".
Viserys's younger brother, Prince Daemon Targaryen,

00:05:27.470 --> 00:05:31.240
one of the most dangerous men in the Seven
Kingdoms, considered himself his brother's

00:05:31.240 --> 00:05:34.450
heir
and coveted the title Prince of Dragonstone.

00:05:34.450 --> 00:05:39.960
While Viserys loved Dameon the Rogue Prince
despite his flaws, he had no wish for Daemon

00:05:39.960 --> 00:05:43.360
to succeed him.
Viserys was hopeful that his wife would give

00:05:43.360 --> 00:05:49.280
him a son soon and settle the succession issue.
Viserys appointed his brother on the small

00:05:49.280 --> 00:05:53.160
council, but the rivalry between Daemon and
the Hand of the King, Ser Otto Hightower,

00:05:53.160 --> 00:05:58.180
became so great … that Viserys in early
104 AC appointed Daemon to be Commander of

00:05:58.180 --> 00:06:01.570
the City Watch to remove Daemon from the small
council.

00:06:01.570 --> 00:06:06.680
Fearful of Daemon becoming a king, Otto tried
to convince Viserys to make Rhaenyra his heir.

00:06:06.680 --> 00:06:11.820
Viserys refused, as he was confident he and
his wife would one day have a son.

00:06:11.820 --> 00:06:17.980
Aemma later became pregnant, to the king's
delight. In 105 AC Aemma died in labor birthing

00:06:17.980 --> 00:06:23.530
the king's son and heir, whom Viserys named
Baelon after his late father, Prince Baelon,

00:06:23.530 --> 00:06:27.990
but the infant died a day after Aemma. While
the king was mourning, his brother Daemon

00:06:27.990 --> 00:06:32.560
was observed making drunken japes with his
company about the "heir for a day".

00:06:32.560 --> 00:06:37.100
When word of this reached the grieving Viserys,
his grief turned to rage.

00:06:37.100 --> 00:06:42.820
After, when the mourning period was over,
Viserys held a lavish ceremony in 105 AC

00:06:42.820 --> 00:06:46.030
and had Rhaenyra declared the heir and Princess
of Dragonstone

00:06:46.030 --> 00:06:51.060
in response to his ungrateful brother's ambitions.
Hundreds of lords and landed knights swore

00:06:51.060 --> 00:06:56.080
fealty to the princess and swore solemn oaths
to defend her rights of succession.

00:06:56.080 --> 00:07:00.740
Daemon left the capital in a fury. Viserys
began to groom Princess Rhaenyra to be the

00:07:00.740 --> 00:07:06.100
ruling queen, teaching her how to rule and
made her part of his small council.

00:07:06.100 --> 00:07:10.910
Since Viserys was not yet thirty, Grand Maester
was the first to urge him to remarry

00:07:10.910 --> 00:07:15.870
and so he did to Alicent Hightower, the eighteen-year-old
daughter of Ser Otto Hightower,

00:07:15.870 --> 00:07:21.400
his Hand of the King. Viserys and Alicent
married in 106 AC.

00:07:21.400 --> 00:07:25.180
Rhaenyra and Alicent at first got on well,
but that soon changed.

00:07:25.180 --> 00:07:29.920
When Daemon and House Velaryon fought a war
for control of the Stepstones against the

00:07:29.920 --> 00:07:33.080
Triarchy,
the peaceful Viserys was unperturbed.

00:07:33.080 --> 00:07:37.320
The fertile Alicent bore a healthy son, Aegon,
in 107 AC.

00:07:37.320 --> 00:07:43.430
A daughter, Helaena followed in 109 AC and
another son named Aemond was born in 110 AC.

00:07:43.430 --> 00:07:47.470
The good relations between Queen Alicent and
Princess Rhaenyra soon ended

00:07:47.470 --> 00:07:52.530
as both desired to be the realm's first lady,
and there could only be one.

00:07:52.530 --> 00:07:57.310
Although Alicent had given Viserys male heirs,
the King did nothing to change the order of

00:07:57.310 --> 00:08:00.360
succession
as he considered the matter already settled

00:08:00.360 --> 00:08:04.700
by naming Rhaenyra in his will.
Otto Hightower tried to pursue The King to

00:08:04.700 --> 00:08:10.080
change his heir from Rhaenyra to Aegon
so much that Viserys sent him back to Oldtown,

00:08:10.080 --> 00:08:16.380
bestowing the position of Hand on Lyonel Strong.
Two parties began to form at court. The queen's

00:08:16.380 --> 00:08:19.900
party consisted of powerful lords friendly
to Alicent

00:08:19.900 --> 00:08:24.930
and supportive of the rights of her sons.
Against that was the party of the princess,

00:08:24.930 --> 00:08:30.240
those who supported Rhaenyra as heir.
In 111 AC, a great tourney was held at King's

00:08:30.240 --> 00:08:36.360
Landing on the fifth anniversary of Viserys's
marriage to Alicent. During the opening feast,

00:08:36.360 --> 00:08:40.190
Queen Alicent wore a green gown,
while Princess Rhaenyra dressed in the red

00:08:40.190 --> 00:08:45.310
and black of House Targaryen.
The note was taken, and soon all of Rhaenyra's

00:08:45.310 --> 00:08:50.230
supporters started wearing black clothing,
while all of Alicent's followers started wearing

00:08:50.230 --> 00:08:53.200
green.
Over the years, the popular names applied

00:08:53.200 --> 00:08:58.070
to both factions were inspired by the colors
they wore: Rhaenyra's supporters were called

00:08:58.070 --> 00:09:02.220
"the Blacks", and Aegon II's supporters were
called "the Greens".

00:09:02.220 --> 00:09:05.090
The tourney also saw the return to the court
of Prince Daemon,

00:09:05.090 --> 00:09:08.700
who reconciled with Viserys offering him the
crown he claimed

00:09:08.700 --> 00:09:13.340
while fighting for the Stepstones, but six
months later Daemon was exiled again from

00:09:13.340 --> 00:09:18.150
King's Landing. While Grand Maester Runciter
claimed the two brothers simply got into a

00:09:18.150 --> 00:09:21.010
fight,
it was rumored that Daemon took Rhaenyra's

00:09:21.010 --> 00:09:25.340
virginity and that Hand of the King counseled
the furious King Viserys that Daemon should

00:09:25.340 --> 00:09:29.740
be executed for treason.
Septon Eustace reminded the council about

00:09:29.740 --> 00:09:33.230
the taint of kingslaying, thus Daemon was
exiled instead.

00:09:33.230 --> 00:09:38.279
Viserys hated conflict and made repeated attempts
to cease the hostilities between the greens

00:09:38.279 --> 00:09:43.410
and the blacks, with many fights and false
apologies issued on both sides.

00:09:43.410 --> 00:09:48.640
He loved his wife and daughter equally, but
they only loved each other when he commanded.

00:09:48.640 --> 00:09:52.660
So long as Viserys ruled, peace prevailed
in the Seven Kingdoms.

00:09:52.660 --> 00:09:57.880
In 113 AC Viserys decided it was time for
his daughter Rhaenyra to wed.

00:09:57.880 --> 00:10:02.440
Queen Alicent wanted the princess to wed her
eldest son, Aegon, so he could one day be

00:10:02.440 --> 00:10:05.910
a king.
Viserys would not hear of it, as Aegon was

00:10:05.910 --> 00:10:10.270
ten years Rhaenyra's junior
and the two had never got on well.

00:10:10.270 --> 00:10:14.650
The king and council chose Laenor Velaryon
to wed Rhaenyra to re-gain the friendship

00:10:14.650 --> 00:10:19.690
between the Iron Throne and Velaryons. Rhaenyra
however, protested the match,

00:10:19.690 --> 00:10:23.370
stating Laenor would prefer her "half brothers"
instead of her.

00:10:23.370 --> 00:10:28.110
Rhaenyra yielded only after Viserys threatened
that if she did not accept the marriage,

00:10:28.110 --> 00:10:32.820
he would change the succession.
So in 114 AC a reluctant Rhaenyra wed Ser

00:10:32.820 --> 00:10:35.250
Laenor,
although it is questioned if the marriage

00:10:35.250 --> 00:10:40.100
was ever consummated.
Laenor spent most of his time on Driftmark,

00:10:40.100 --> 00:10:45.720
surrounded by handsome squires
and infrequently visited Rhaenyra on Dragonstone.

00:10:45.720 --> 00:10:50.490
Later the same year Rhaenyra gave birth to
her first son, Jacaerys Velaryon.

00:10:50.490 --> 00:10:55.800
However, due to the babe not having the traditional
Valyrian features of either of his parents,

00:10:55.800 --> 00:11:00.230
Laenor and Rhaenyra both had light silver/gold
hair and purple eyes,

00:11:00.230 --> 00:11:04.610
rumor spread that the child's real father
was her lover Ser Harwin Strong,

00:11:04.610 --> 00:11:09.700
the strongest man in Westeros called Breakbones
and Rhaenyra's sworn shield who resided with

00:11:09.700 --> 00:11:13.880
her on Dragonstone.
Queen Alicent bore a third son, Daeron, to

00:11:13.880 --> 00:11:18.180
King Viserys the same year.
Viserys got two more grandsons years later

00:11:18.180 --> 00:11:23.380
by Rhaenyra,
Lucerys Velaryon born in 115 AC and Joffrey

00:11:23.380 --> 00:11:28.050
Velaryon in 117 AC.
All three of Rhaenyra's children had pug noses,

00:11:28.050 --> 00:11:31.630
brown hair, and brown eyes,
further spreading the belief throughout the

00:11:31.630 --> 00:11:35.310
kingdom that the children's real sire was
Ser Harwin Strong.

00:11:35.310 --> 00:11:39.650
The Greens were the ones who sparked this
rumor, often calling them Strongs.

00:11:39.650 --> 00:11:44.230
Prince Daemon and his wife, Laena Velaryon,
had twin daughters named Baela and Rhaena.

00:11:44.230 --> 00:11:48.720
The brothers Daemon and Viserys reconciled
a second time and with the blessing of the

00:11:48.720 --> 00:11:53.620
king Princess Rhaenyra betrothed Jacaerys
and Lucerys to Baela and Rhaena.

00:11:53.620 --> 00:11:58.120
The year 120 AC became known as the Year of
the Red Spring because of its many deaths

00:11:58.120 --> 00:12:03.450
and accidents. Laena Velaryon, the wife of
Prince Daemon Targaryen, died after a failed

00:12:03.450 --> 00:12:06.800
birth.
At her funeral, a quarrel broke out between

00:12:06.800 --> 00:12:11.950
Aemond Targaryen and the sons of Rhaenyra,
who were accused of being bastards from House

00:12:11.950 --> 00:12:15.490
Strong.
Aemond lost an eye when Lucerys defended Jacaerys

00:12:15.490 --> 00:12:18.930
with a knife.
The false apologies from the families of Rhaenyra

00:12:18.930 --> 00:12:24.040
and Alicent fooled no one, but Viserys.
The king issued an edict that anyone spreading

00:12:24.040 --> 00:12:28.450
the Strong rumor would lose their tongue,
and ordered Ser Harwin Strong to depart from

00:12:28.450 --> 00:12:32.520
Dragonstone to Harrenhal.
Afterwards, a massive fire at Harrenhal killed

00:12:32.520 --> 00:12:37.029
Harwin and his father Lyonel,
the Hand of the King. While some blamed it

00:12:37.029 --> 00:12:40.740
on the curse of Harrenhal,
others whispered that Daemon, Lord Corlys

00:12:40.740 --> 00:12:44.230
Velaryon, and even Viserys were responsible
for the blaze.

00:12:44.230 --> 00:12:47.850
The king recalled Ser Otto Hightower as the
King's Hand.

00:12:47.850 --> 00:12:51.620
The year also saw the death of Rhaenyra's
husband, Laenor Velaryon,

00:12:51.620 --> 00:12:55.720
killed in a fight between his companion and
lover, Ser Qarl Correy

00:12:55.720 --> 00:12:58.810
who many whisper was hired by Daemon to do
so.

00:12:58.810 --> 00:13:02.580
Rhaenyra and Daemon shocked the realm by wedding
without Viserys's knowledge,

00:13:02.580 --> 00:13:07.110
a huge scandal, as neither Laena nor Laenor
had been dead for six months.

00:13:07.110 --> 00:13:12.830
It made Viserys furious. It took some time
before Viserys and Daemon reconciled.

00:13:12.830 --> 00:13:17.080
The year ended with Rhaenyra and Daemon welcoming
the birth of their first son,

00:13:17.080 --> 00:13:20.930
Prince Aegon the Younger. Another son, born
in 122 AC,

00:13:20.930 --> 00:13:25.330
was given the name Viserys after Rhaenyra's
father, King Viserys himself.

00:13:25.330 --> 00:13:29.010
Rhaenyra's sons by Daemon and all had Targaryen
features.

00:13:29.010 --> 00:13:33.951
The forced closeness of Rhaenyra's and Alicent's
children increased animosity between the blacks

00:13:33.951 --> 00:13:38.190
and greens. The royal children and grandchildren
became Dragonriders

00:13:38.190 --> 00:13:41.060
and court visitors observed the dragons of
one faction

00:13:41.060 --> 00:13:45.120
snapping and spitting flames at the dragons
of the other party.

00:13:45.120 --> 00:13:49.710
Viserys died on the third day of the third
moon of 129 AC

00:13:49.710 --> 00:13:54.490
during a nap in the Red Keep of King's Landing.
On his death bed, he refused to change the

00:13:54.490 --> 00:14:01.030
succession and decreed his heir to be Rhaenyra.
He was found dead by a servant who first went

00:14:01.030 --> 00:14:06.140
to Alicent to inform her of Viserys's death,
which proved to be a grave mistake as Alicent

00:14:06.140 --> 00:14:09.060
proclaimed Aegon the King over the wishes
of Viserys.

00:14:09.060 --> 00:14:12.930
At the time of her father's death, Rhaenyra
was on Dragonstone.

00:14:12.930 --> 00:14:16.870
The greens in King's Landing ensured that
the news of the Viserys's death did not reach

00:14:16.870 --> 00:14:19.610
her
until her own supporters in the Red Keep were

00:14:19.610 --> 00:14:24.370
dead or imprisoned
and Aegon II's coronation had already occurred.

00:14:24.370 --> 00:14:28.740
King Viserys decreed Rhaenyra to succeed him,
but Aegon the Elder, the eldest son of his

00:14:28.740 --> 00:14:34.330
second wife Alicent, was instead crowned Aegon
II by Ser Criston Cole, the Lord Commander

00:14:34.330 --> 00:14:37.870
of the Kingsguard.
This led to a civil war between Rhaenyra and

00:14:37.870 --> 00:14:42.029
Aegon , the Dance of the Dragons.
The devastating civil war that tore apart

00:14:42.029 --> 00:14:46.120
the Seven Kingdoms.
The war lasted for three years, and by the

00:14:46.120 --> 00:14:50.680
time it came to an end thousands were dead,
nearly all of the Targaryen dragons had been

00:14:50.680 --> 00:14:55.911
killed as well as many Targaryens themselves.
King Viserys I will be the main character

00:14:55.911 --> 00:15:00.270
in the first season and upon his death,
the realm will explode into a massive civil

00:15:00.270 --> 00:15:04.500
war between the Blacks and the Greens,
the Targaryen civil war known as the Dance

00:15:04.500 --> 00:15:08.839
of the Dragons.
20 major battles, even more smaller battles

00:15:08.839 --> 00:15:14.130
and even more betrayals, turncloaks, and twists.
All of that and more this Game of Thrones

00:15:14.130 --> 00:15:17.870
prequel show, House of the Dragon, brings
in 2022.

00:15:17.870 --> 00:15:21.260
Let me know your thoughts about everything:
the prequel, its characters, especially King

00:15:21.260 --> 00:15:23.240
Viserys,
in the comment section down below.

